  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The TAWLA intends to implement a project on &quot;Enhancing GG,            Accountability and GE. Specific objectives are 1) advocate for GG and accountability, 2) undertake gender sensitive policy research &amp;       advocay on legal reform 3) promote respect for rights of vulnerable   people i.e women and children and 4) advocate for SRHR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Tanzania Women Lawyers Association intends to implement a project on &quot;Enhancing Good Governance, Accountability and Gender Equity.      Specific objectives are: 1) advocate for good governance and          accountability, 2) undertake gender sensitive policy research &amp;       advocacy on legal reform,3) promote respect for rights of vulnerable  people i.e women6 children 4) Advocate for SRHR</narrative>
  </description>
